<title>JAPAN: Sharp shares fall due to LCD rivals.</title>
<headline>Sharp shares fall due to LCD rivals.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Sharp Corp fell on the Tokyo Stock Exchange on Tuesday morning for a fifth consecutive trading day as other makers have entered the liquid crystal display (LCD) business, the brokers said.</p>
</text>
